Setting possible within the scope of the 300.0 [Hz] >= resonance frequency> anti-resonance frequency >= 10.0 [Hz].",135,,,,,,,
,,,"When not the above magnitude relationship,vibration suppression filter and filter resonance characteristic is invalid.",118,,,,,,,
6,69,2nd anti-resonance damping ratio,Sets the 2nd anti-resonance damping ratio of the load  in mode of model type damping filter enabled.,100,,,,,,,
,,,"Damping ratio is set by the setting value * 0.001.
When the set value of 1000, damping 1 (no peak).
Decreasing the setting value, the damping ratio is reduced. (Resonance peak is large)",185,,,,,,,
6,70,2nd response frequency,Sets the 2nd  response damping ratio of the load  in mode of model type damping filter enabled.,95,,,,,,,
,,,"The unit is [0.1Hz].
Setting possible within the scope of the 300.0 [Hz] >= 2nd anti-resonance frequency * 4 >= 2nd response frequency >= 2nd anti-resonance frequency >= 10.0 [Hz].",180,,,,,,,
,,,"When not the above magnitude relationship, vibration suppression filter and filter resonance characteristic is invalid.",119,,,,,,,
6,71,2nd Viscous friction compensating gain,"Sets the 2nd viscous friction compensating gain
The unit is [rated thrust 0.1%/ (10000 r/min)].
Note)When the Real-time auto tuning setup = 4, and is set automatically. Please use its value usually.",198,,,,,,,
6,73,Over-load warning detection level,"Sets the threshold value to issue a warning when the overload factor continues to increase.
Setting is made using the overload factor.
",135,,,,,,,
6,74,Over-load warning release level,"Sets the threshold value to cancel a warning when the load factor decreases from the overload warning state.
Setting is made using the overload factor.
",152,,,,,,,
